WEBVTT

00:03.385 --> 00:06.679
Nothing's there.
They're both empty.

00:06.722 --> 00:08.473
Other than this piece of paper…

00:10.851 --> 00:13.103
<i>The scent has transferred
outside the pocket…</i>

00:13.186 --> 00:14.187
<i>Could it be…</i>

00:19.735 --> 00:21.778
It's just a blank piece of paper.

00:27.576 --> 00:28.577
What?!

00:28.577 --> 00:30.203
BLAM

00:30.245 --> 00:33.456
J-Josuke!

00:33.957 --> 00:36.125
JULY 15TH (THURS) 12:42 PM

00:40.464 --> 00:43.300
SWIP

00:44.426 --> 00:45.760
You really stepped in it!

00:45.802 --> 00:48.554
Goodness, you should really
be more careful.

00:48.597 --> 00:52.892
I warned you about
the fire damage up here, didn't I?

00:55.562 --> 00:58.314
I honestly don't see
what all the fuss is about.

00:58.690 --> 01:00.066
You have a very respectable back…

01:03.278 --> 01:07.699
I-It's over… I'm through…

01:08.825 --> 01:10.034
It doesn't make any sense…

01:10.118 --> 01:13.830
I have this horrible feeling I'm
gonna die if someone sees my back!

01:14.206 --> 01:15.165
H-Hey…

01:15.207 --> 01:17.751
It's too late, I'm as good as dead!

01:18.084 --> 01:19.210
Just calm yourself down.

01:19.294 --> 01:20.378
I'm sorry.

01:20.462 --> 01:22.380
My curiosity got
the best of me and…

01:25.258 --> 01:26.509
What in the?!

01:29.137 --> 01:30.930
He was attacked by a Stand!

01:30.972 --> 01:33.224
The Stand attached itself
to his back?!

01:33.683 --> 01:36.811
If it did, Heaven's Door
wouldn't be able to…

01:36.853 --> 01:38.855
Of course, his notes
wouldn't reveal that.

01:39.314 --> 01:43.109
<i>He was already overcome
by the time he go there.</i>

01:43.193 --> 01:45.278
<i>This architect is the victim.</i>

01:45.320 --> 01:48.197
<i>The Stand overwhelmed him
to get to me.</i>

01:49.115 --> 01:50.574
Piggyback, please.

01:52.285 --> 01:54.537
It's here! It's the enemy Stand!

01:56.248 --> 01:58.333
Let's play piggyback, okay?

01:59.334 --> 02:01.169
Piggyback, please.

02:01.837 --> 02:05.757
Piggyback… piggyback, please?

02:09.386 --> 02:11.054
<i>Breakdown, Breakdown</i>

02:11.763 --> 02:13.890
<i>(Listen up)
Breakdown, Breakdown</i>

02:14.641 --> 02:16.559
<i>(Listen)
Breakdown, Breakdown</i>

02:17.853 --> 02:20.897
<i>Breakdown, Breakdown
(3, 2, 1) Let's Go!</i>

02:20.981 --> 02:22.107
JOJO'S BIZARRE ADVENTURE
DIAMOND IS UNBREAKABLE

02:22.190 --> 02:26.690
<i>Shining Justice begins to sprout</i>

02:27.696 --> 02:32.196
<i>Brand-new bed town
Will we meet? Let's find out</i>

02:33.368 --> 02:37.868
<i>Feeling the sea breeze from the cape
through the tunnel to the tower</i>

02:38.999 --> 02:43.499
<i>We wander into the alley,
drawn to each other</i>

02:44.296 --> 02:48.796
<i>A shadow melts into our hearts</i>

02:51.678 --> 02:56.178
<i>But the golden spirits
shine a light to protect us</i>

03:01.563 --> 03:06.063
<i>Let the voice of love
take you higher</i>

03:06.568 --> 03:11.068
<i>Let the gathering forces
overcome time itself</i>

03:12.908 --> 03:17.408
<i>1999 Bizarre Summer</i>

03:17.829 --> 03:22.329
<i>Our courage keeps the town in bloom</i>

03:23.418 --> 03:27.588
<i>Great Days</i>

03:30.008 --> 03:33.428
JULY 15TH (THURS) 1:39 PM

03:31.635 --> 03:33.449
Here's a list of
missing persons cases in Morioh,

03:34.930 --> 03:36.097
including runaways.

03:36.806 --> 03:41.306
EPISODE 33
JULY 15TH (THURS), PART 3

03:37.057 --> 03:39.350
The data reflects the period
after Kira's disappearance,

03:39.434 --> 03:41.144
hence the small number.

03:42.312 --> 03:46.812
So some could very well
be Kira's victims.

03:47.609 --> 03:50.320
We don't know for sure,
that is a possibility.

03:50.779 --> 03:54.324
At this point,
we have to follow his every move.

03:54.908 --> 03:57.952
Even the most seemingly
insignificant of activities

03:58.328 --> 04:00.789
can have a far-reaching effect.

04:00.664 --> 04:02.582
M PREFECTURE S CITY,
MISSING PERSONS

04:01.289 --> 04:02.290
Time and time again.

04:02.624 --> 04:04.042
JULY 15TH (THURS) 12:55 PM

04:04.709 --> 04:06.836
Piggyback, please?

04:06.920 --> 04:08.046
Piggyback.

04:08.129 --> 04:09.839
Heaven's Door!

04:12.509 --> 04:15.220
Piggyback, please?

04:15.387 --> 04:16.513
Piggyback.

04:16.554 --> 04:18.847
What?! I don't believe it…

04:19.015 --> 04:21.142
It's attached itself to my back?

04:21.643 --> 04:25.021
Did it latch onto me because
I looked at the architect's back?

04:25.063 --> 04:26.064
Blast it!

04:31.152 --> 04:32.695
Ignite the pictures…

04:33.571 --> 04:35.698
Please, ignite the pictures.

04:35.782 --> 04:37.200
The pictures?

04:37.409 --> 04:41.037
Ignite them, please?
Get rid of the pictures…

04:41.079 --> 04:42.371
What are you talking about?

04:43.415 --> 04:44.999
These are the pictures I took…

04:45.333 --> 04:47.043
Could one of them be…

04:47.127 --> 04:49.087
Could one of them lead us
to Yoshikage Kira…

04:49.170 --> 04:51.297
You're trying to get rid of it…

04:51.548 --> 04:56.048
Just ignite them all, please?
You get rid of them, yes?

04:56.219 --> 04:57.553
Shut up, you parasite!

04:58.847 --> 05:00.390
Heaven's Door!

05:00.682 --> 05:01.516
How 'bout this…

05:01.558 --> 05:04.561
I'll read your powers,
then inscribe my mandate…

05:06.187 --> 05:06.937
Ow!

05:08.440 --> 05:09.899
What?!

05:09.983 --> 05:14.195
I was given life when Masazo Kinoto
was impaled by the arrow…

05:14.237 --> 05:15.613
I'm Cheap Trap.

05:15.697 --> 05:20.197
But now my user is Rohan Kishibe.
I've relocated to you.

05:20.368 --> 05:23.037
You're my user now.

05:23.163 --> 05:23.997
Wha?!

05:24.039 --> 05:25.081
Understand?

05:25.206 --> 05:28.459
In other words, you're attacking
yourself with a Stand.

05:28.626 --> 05:30.419
You understand, yes?

05:30.754 --> 05:32.922
I'm a Stand with a will of my own.

05:33.048 --> 05:35.091
I may have come into being
through Masazo Kinoto,

05:35.175 --> 05:38.678
but he couldn't control me
as a Stand user.

05:39.345 --> 05:42.181
My whispers inundated his mind,

05:42.432 --> 05:46.811
the terror of being seen
from behind consumed him, yes?

05:46.936 --> 05:49.939
You understand, yes? Understand?

05:52.275 --> 05:53.859
Understand, yes?

05:54.027 --> 05:56.779
My only power is to whisper
nothings into the ears of my host.

05:56.863 --> 05:59.282
Yes? You understand,
so let's burn those pictures.

05:59.365 --> 06:00.616
Dirty leech, get off me!

06:04.954 --> 06:06.372
Dammit, you bastard…

06:06.414 --> 06:07.998
I have to get you off me!

06:08.541 --> 06:11.418
It's simple.
You just have to show me off.

06:11.544 --> 06:13.462
Just show someone your back…

06:13.546 --> 06:16.549
Yes? I'll leave you and
take hold of another soul.

06:16.591 --> 06:18.301
Just a quick flash is all it takes.

06:20.178 --> 06:22.054
Afternoon, Rohan-sensei!

06:22.388 --> 06:24.306
I'm an avid reader.

06:24.516 --> 06:25.975
Now, don't forget the nudes, 'kay…

06:26.226 --> 06:27.685
That's nude women, 'kay!

06:30.105 --> 06:31.231
See, ya!

06:32.690 --> 06:34.650
Let's incinerate those photos, yes?

06:36.111 --> 06:37.445
JULY 15TH (THURS) 12:47 PM

06:38.238 --> 06:39.280
Josuke!

06:41.157 --> 06:43.242
The bullet didn't get him.

06:43.451 --> 06:45.369
Y-You asshole!

06:46.955 --> 06:48.748
Shining Diamond, eh?

06:48.832 --> 06:51.251
Well, I guess the rumors
were right,

06:51.459 --> 06:55.129
taking a bullet point blank
poses no problem…

06:56.464 --> 06:59.633
<i>Freaky, right?
Bite it, Josuke Higashikata.</i>

06:59.676 --> 07:00.968
<i>Chomp down on that lip.</i>

07:03.346 --> 07:04.096
<i>Will he bite?!</i>

07:04.139 --> 07:06.432
<i>Bite it! Come on,
show me that bite,</i>

07:06.474 --> 07:08.267
<i>show me your mark of fear!</i>

07:08.810 --> 07:10.686
So this is his Stand?

07:10.812 --> 07:12.271
What a pathetic, third rate Stand,

07:12.313 --> 07:14.356
just like that old man
in the photo!

07:15.483 --> 07:17.193
<i>Still won't bite, eh…</i>

07:17.443 --> 07:20.028
<i>Trying to cover up
your fear with anger, eh…</i>

07:20.488 --> 07:21.530
<i>I suppose I must.</i>

07:21.573 --> 07:23.658
<i>I guess it's time
for the big reveal.</i>

07:27.036 --> 07:29.872
Smug bastard… You're dead!

07:30.331 --> 07:33.417
<i>Something's off.. this is too weird.</i>

07:33.710 --> 07:35.169
<i>He's been hiding
this whole time,</i>

07:35.211 --> 07:36.962
<i>why would he come out now?</i>

07:37.088 --> 07:38.589
<i>This is all a trap.</i>

07:38.673 --> 07:41.258
<i>He made himself appear now
so that you would attack him!</i>

07:41.843 --> 07:45.054
<i>This guy's dangerous…
Get the hell outta there, Josuke!</i>

07:46.389 --> 07:50.142
It's true… I guess I've got
a pathetic, third rate Stand.

07:50.518 --> 07:53.062
But I suppose
if I had to explain it…

07:53.146 --> 07:55.314
It would be that I can transform
almost anything

07:55.440 --> 07:59.152
into a piece of paper to be filed
discretely and conveniently.

08:04.032 --> 08:07.076
In fact,
this here is Koichi Hirose.

08:07.202 --> 08:10.163
You bastard… So that's
where you were hiding Koichi!

08:10.205 --> 08:11.706
<i>I'm picking up Koichi's scent.</i>

08:11.915 --> 08:16.377
<i>He wasn't holding on to one of
Koichi's belongings… He had Koichi!</i>

08:16.502 --> 08:18.295
Of course, he's alive…

08:18.379 --> 08:21.673
My Stand is pathetic
and third rate, after all.

08:21.883 --> 08:24.760
It doesn't have the power or
ability to kill someone.

08:24.886 --> 08:28.264
But if someone were to
tear it into little pieces,

08:28.348 --> 08:29.474
that's a different story.

08:29.933 --> 08:33.227
I'll let you off easy
and beat you to a bloody pulp,

08:33.394 --> 08:35.562
as long as you bring
Koichi back now.

08:35.813 --> 08:37.272
Try and get him…

08:37.398 --> 08:38.982
If you can.

08:44.614 --> 08:46.282
KOICHI HIROSE

08:48.409 --> 08:49.451
Koichi!

08:49.786 --> 08:52.789
<i>My Stand is pathetic
and third rate, after all.</i>

08:52.872 --> 08:55.374
<i>It doesn't have the power or
ability to kill someone.</i>

08:55.416 --> 08:56.959
<i>But if someone were to
tear it into little pieces,</i>

08:57.001 --> 08:58.252
<i>that's a different story</i>

08:58.670 --> 09:00.338
<i>It's a trap!</i>

09:00.421 --> 09:02.297
<i>I would not go after that paper.</i>

09:02.465 --> 09:04.341
<i>Josuke, ignore it.</i>

09:08.471 --> 09:11.140
There's that bite!
You finally bit it!

09:11.724 --> 09:15.978
Misterioso was waiting for
this moment, Josuke Higashikata!

09:16.229 --> 09:19.815
The moment you bite your lip!

09:32.245 --> 09:34.038
You goddamn, devious, mother…

09:34.122 --> 09:36.833
You just revealed
your mark of fear!

09:38.293 --> 09:40.670
Resist all you like,
your display of anxiety

09:40.753 --> 09:43.422
has made you powerless
before Misterioso.

09:48.261 --> 09:49.095
THUD

09:51.097 --> 09:52.473
<i>I'm really sorry, Josuke,</i>

09:52.515 --> 09:54.558
<i>but I'm glad we made
that little agreement.</i>

09:54.684 --> 09:58.104
<i>If I had tried to help,
he would've gotten me first.</i>

09:58.187 --> 10:01.190
<i>I'm the one with
scent-discerning abilities.</i>

10:03.818 --> 10:06.195
Now do you understand that

10:06.279 --> 10:10.074
Misterioso is the most unstoppable
force the world has ever seen?

10:15.121 --> 10:17.540
W-What?

10:17.665 --> 10:19.583
He's repairing the metal pole…

10:19.667 --> 10:21.794
That's how he's trying to escape.

10:23.046 --> 10:25.298
I'm guessing that piece of paper

10:25.340 --> 10:28.968
is not the one
holding Koichi right now.

10:29.010 --> 10:33.510
I knew that was just a dirty decoy
with "Koichi Hirose" written on it.

10:34.474 --> 10:38.478
You were holding Koichi hostage,

10:38.644 --> 10:41.647
which gave you the confidence
to reveal your true self.

10:41.856 --> 10:45.192
It's because he's alive
that you can threaten me.

10:45.693 --> 10:49.196
I knew that piece of paper
was a trap…

10:49.322 --> 10:51.282
I was pretty damn sure, at least…

10:52.533 --> 10:57.033
But I went after
that little piece of paper

10:57.914 --> 11:02.414
because there was still a chance
it was Koichi.

11:02.585 --> 11:06.130
I don't care if it's a 1 % chance,

11:06.714 --> 11:09.925
that's a chance
I'm just not willing to take!

11:11.803 --> 11:14.764
Misterioso, this is your win.

11:14.847 --> 11:18.559
There's not much more Shining
Diamond can do at this point.

11:18.684 --> 11:21.520
But let me offer you
a little heads-up…

11:21.771 --> 11:23.439
If you do turn me
into a piece of paper,

11:23.564 --> 11:26.149
I'd rip it up into
oblivion real quick.

11:26.526 --> 11:29.737
Cause if I do make it
out of this alive,

11:29.779 --> 11:31.614
I'll freak in knock you dead!

11:40.706 --> 11:43.291
Flattering yourself again I see…

11:43.584 --> 11:46.295
You weren't so tough.

11:47.839 --> 11:49.131
KOICHI HIROSE

11:54.929 --> 11:56.639
Yuya Fungami, huh?

11:57.515 --> 12:01.519
Not helping out Josuke
was a very wise move.

12:01.894 --> 12:05.063
I could have easily
disposed of you.

12:05.106 --> 12:09.110
Your mark of fear
is a stroke of the chin.

12:10.653 --> 12:15.153
But the old man in the photo
never told me to kill you,

12:15.616 --> 12:17.367
so I guess you escaped death.

12:17.618 --> 12:19.703
Smart move, my friend.

12:27.795 --> 12:31.381
Wanna hear something interesting?
This paper…

12:31.466 --> 12:35.678
Anyone can release its contents
by the simple act of unfolding.

12:35.845 --> 12:37.680
Straightforward, yes,

12:37.722 --> 12:40.433
but for someone consumed with fear,
it's surprisingly difficult.

12:46.481 --> 12:48.691
Morioh Grand Hotel, please.

12:49.108 --> 12:52.611
Superb! Koichi Hirose
and Josuke Higashikata

12:52.653 --> 12:54.196
have been disposed of!

12:54.238 --> 12:57.199
Now, Rohan Kishibe
should be enjoying the same…

12:59.160 --> 13:02.079
JULY 15TH (THURS) 2:21 PM

13:00.203 --> 13:01.204
Which one?

13:01.662 --> 13:02.100
Which one has something to do
with Yoshikage Kira?

13:04.373 --> 13:07.042
Which picture is that old man
so worried about?

13:07.126 --> 13:09.503
Burn them, okay? Just burn.

13:09.837 --> 13:10.838
It's no use…

13:10.963 --> 13:13.465
They're just aren't enough clues.

13:13.591 --> 13:15.801
So let's burn the pictures, yes?

13:15.843 --> 13:17.386
Shut up!
You're getting on my nerves!

13:17.845 --> 13:20.055
<i>Damn it! I have to let them know…</i>

13:20.348 --> 13:22.892
<i>I have to let somebody know</i>

13:26.812 --> 13:29.397
TERUNOSUKE MIYAMOTO

13:29.440 --> 13:32.276
JULY 15TH (THURS) 1:20 PM

13:30.149 --> 13:32.297
Er, that was
Morioh Grand Hotel, right?

13:33.694 --> 13:34.945
That's right.

13:35.279 --> 13:36.697
Spending the night?

13:36.739 --> 13:39.992
Well, I've got a lot
to take care of…

13:40.576 --> 13:41.785
A lot, indeed…

13:41.869 --> 13:42.786
No…

13:42.870 --> 13:45.122
I can't let you go to
Morioh Grand Hotel.

13:46.749 --> 13:50.085
Josuke, you bastard! Pompous ass…

13:52.255 --> 13:55.925
If one of them were turned into
a piece of paper, if…

13:56.008 --> 13:58.093
I can't believe I'm saying this…

13:58.135 --> 14:02.635
If anything like that ever happened
to my loving, supporting girls…

14:03.057 --> 14:06.518
If it happened to any one of them,

14:07.061 --> 14:09.646
You bastard, I'd do the exact same!

14:09.897 --> 14:11.607
Besides, how'd that make me look

14:11.649 --> 14:14.693
if I let you or Yoshikage Kira
live in this town.

14:14.735 --> 14:16.486
Hand over Koichi!

14:16.571 --> 14:20.616
This, however, is not a wise move.

14:21.284 --> 14:24.620
So you're saying
you want to take me on?

14:24.912 --> 14:28.248
Which means you're saying you want
to make an enemy of Kira's father?

14:28.583 --> 14:29.917
So be it!

14:30.001 --> 14:33.838
63, 64, 65 kilometers…

14:34.005 --> 14:36.298
It may not be a powerhouse,

14:36.382 --> 14:39.676
but Highway Go Go
is a relentless hunter.

14:46.142 --> 14:48.519
The taxi stopped…

14:48.894 --> 14:51.479
But we're not at the hotel.

14:52.398 --> 14:55.776
No one's getting out of the taxi.

14:56.611 --> 15:00.281
I'm picking up his scent
loud and clear from the car…

15:00.448 --> 15:04.493
But where is he?
Where is he hiding?

15:06.245 --> 15:08.330
The scent of this paper…

15:08.414 --> 15:09.832
There's no question…

15:09.957 --> 15:13.126
This paper smells like
Koichi and Josuke!

15:13.419 --> 15:16.338
Wait, Highway Go Go!
Don't open the door yet.

15:16.464 --> 15:18.299
Bastard, he thinks I'm an idiot.

15:18.466 --> 15:20.468
He's planted another trap.

15:20.718 --> 15:22.928
Trying to lure me in, huh?

15:23.137 --> 15:25.180
Fine, I accept your challenge!

15:25.556 --> 15:27.516
I said I'd fight you!

15:27.767 --> 15:30.352
<i>He wants me to be afraid.</i>

15:30.561 --> 15:33.564
<i>The question is,
how's he gonna do it?</i>

15:34.190 --> 15:36.025
<i>I've gotta find out.</i>

15:36.817 --> 15:40.862
<i>What the? What's this piece
of paper stuck in the door?</i>

15:44.325 --> 15:47.036
Underestimating me again.
This scent…

15:47.161 --> 15:48.871
This piece of paper is a trap.

15:48.913 --> 15:50.873
And I figured out what kind, too.

15:51.415 --> 15:53.708
Open the door, Highway Go Go.

15:57.046 --> 15:58.047
FOOM

16:01.133 --> 16:03.760
So he can turn fire
into paper, too…

16:03.844 --> 16:06.012
I see through your little trick!

16:06.180 --> 16:09.683
Josuke, Koichi,
I'll get both of you out of there!

16:10.351 --> 16:14.851
But I'm picking up
Josuke, Koichi, and something else…

16:17.358 --> 16:20.235
I'm going to have to be
very careful…

16:22.530 --> 16:23.531
What's going on?

16:23.698 --> 16:26.409
I've never smelled this before,
and it's moving around.

16:26.492 --> 16:28.702
It's faint,
and it's moving around inside…

16:31.706 --> 16:32.707
What?!

16:32.748 --> 16:34.875
Crap! Highway Go Go!

16:36.836 --> 16:38.838
W-What is this stuff?

16:39.422 --> 16:41.424
Some kind of chemical?

16:41.757 --> 16:43.967
Shit, it's one thing after another…

16:44.051 --> 16:46.470
W-Wait…

16:46.679 --> 16:48.931
I'm smelling iron now.

16:50.391 --> 16:54.269
Okay, just calm down.
Remember, he wants me to be scared.

16:54.311 --> 16:56.896
If I freak out, he wins.

16:57.356 --> 16:58.315
Iron…

16:58.399 --> 17:00.192
What is it? A machine?

17:02.737 --> 17:03.738
Damn it!

17:04.071 --> 17:06.198
I just hafta open it!

17:06.449 --> 17:08.367
KOICHI HIROSE
JOSUKE HIGASHIKATA

17:06.657 --> 17:08.388
Josuke! Koichi!

17:11.036 --> 17:12.787
Electricity…

17:13.038 --> 17:15.290
He can hide electricity in paper!

17:15.332 --> 17:19.832
That mechanical smell is…

17:20.629 --> 17:22.881
KOICHI HIROSE
JOSUKE HIGASHIKATA

17:26.844 --> 17:27.845
A…

17:28.262 --> 17:29.596
A shredder!

17:37.688 --> 17:38.647
It won't turn off!

17:38.773 --> 17:40.858
It's pulling Josuke and Koichi in!

17:40.941 --> 17:43.276
Damn it! Highway Go Go!

17:47.281 --> 17:48.407
I-It's no use.

17:48.449 --> 17:52.161
Highway Go Go isn't strong enough
to stop this thing!

17:57.124 --> 17:59.918
Josuke! Koichi!

17:59.960 --> 18:02.671
You finally did it, Yuya Fungami.

18:03.005 --> 18:05.132
The onset of fear,
followed by a touch to the chin…

18:05.174 --> 18:07.342
Fear is so not a good look on you.

18:11.430 --> 18:15.930
Scaring you was
surprisingly simple, Yuya Fungami!

18:16.519 --> 18:20.272
Misterioso can turn absolutely
anyone into a piece of paper!

18:20.773 --> 18:23.650
Anyone, any time!

18:23.734 --> 18:26.862
Anytime? That's why it's so great!

18:26.904 --> 18:30.198
It instantly transforms its target
into a piece of paper…

18:30.950 --> 18:32.493
Isn't that great!

18:33.702 --> 18:37.038
Fine, you win.
You really got me there.

18:37.122 --> 18:39.874
To tell you the truth,
I couldn't be happier to lose.

18:40.000 --> 18:41.960
Being a flimsy piece of paper
has its advantages,

18:42.002 --> 18:45.296
How else could I reach inside
the shredder!

18:45.756 --> 18:47.632
What did you just pull out?!

18:47.842 --> 18:50.553
You better not unfold
that piece of paper!

18:53.430 --> 18:57.892
I'll turn into a piece
of paper any day.

18:58.853 --> 19:00.896
JOSUKE HIGASHIKATA
KOICHI HIROSE

19:03.607 --> 19:06.610
Yuya Fungami… I guess you…

19:06.694 --> 19:10.781
kinda, sorta are a cool guy.

19:11.198 --> 19:14.743
Josuke Higashikata… Koichi Hirose…

19:17.788 --> 19:21.917
S-Stay back, Josuke!
Get a load of this!

19:22.209 --> 19:24.211
I-I'll rip it to pieces!

19:24.253 --> 19:27.172
Yuya Fungami
is in this piece of paper!

19:29.341 --> 19:32.802
Act 3! 3 Freeze!

19:33.053 --> 19:35.013
The pressure…

19:35.055 --> 19:37.474
Now, what was it?

19:37.725 --> 19:40.936
I know there's something
I'm forgetting here…

19:41.020 --> 19:42.938
Oh, that's right.

19:42.980 --> 19:45.941
I think I said I'd kill you.

19:46.108 --> 19:48.902
Yeah, I definitely said that.

19:50.863 --> 19:55.363
I think I also said I'd never
forgive someone like you.

19:56.327 --> 19:58.162
Someone who takes hostages…

19:58.412 --> 20:01.665
Someone who uses
psychological blackmail…

20:01.749 --> 20:03.667
W-Wait a minute!

20:03.751 --> 20:07.963
I just wanted to observe
people's reaction to fear stimuli!

20:08.005 --> 20:09.881
I just acquired my Stand,

20:09.924 --> 20:11.800
so I guess I got
a little carried away.

20:12.009 --> 20:14.428
I'm sorry. I feel horrible now.

20:14.470 --> 20:17.347
You know, there's something
I noticed about you…

20:18.432 --> 20:19.558
Huh?

20:19.767 --> 20:24.267
I think you squint one eye
when you're scared.

20:25.314 --> 20:27.149
I guess you could say it's a habit.

20:28.025 --> 20:29.026
But…

20:29.944 --> 20:32.821
When you really freak out
you close both.

20:44.875 --> 20:48.837
You like observing people, huh?
Then go right ahead.

20:48.921 --> 20:52.299
But you're gonna keep
your mouth shut and behave.

20:53.592 --> 20:56.845
I-I'm a book…

20:56.971 --> 20:59.515
<i>The young Misterioso,
Terunosuke Miyamoto,</i>

20:59.765 --> 21:01.975
<i>human book and out of commission.</i>

21:02.226 --> 21:04.853
<i>Josuke never bothered reading it,</i>

21:04.937 --> 21:07.105
<i>but instead donated it
to the Morioh Library</i>

21:07.189 --> 21:09.191
<i>Just mention "Misterioso"
to any librarian,</i>

21:09.274 --> 21:10.525
<i>and you can read it in house.</i>

21:10.651 --> 21:11.777
<i>Borrowing is forbidden.</i>

21:12.027 --> 21:16.527
<i>Don't be surprised,
you may hear a faint voice.</i>

21:16.907 --> 21:19.242
Well, that's taken care of.

21:17.324 --> 21:19.367
MORIOH LIBRARY

21:19.952 --> 21:22.454
Why do I feel like
I've spoken too soon…

21:22.830 --> 21:27.330
But this means we're that much
closer to catching Yoshikage Kira.

21:28.502 --> 21:31.379
But we still got no clues.

21:33.173 --> 21:37.635
Dammit all…
resilient little bastards!

21:38.470 --> 21:40.972
JULY 15TH (THURS) 4:10 PM

21:42.558 --> 21:45.269
Calling them for help won't work.

21:45.352 --> 21:48.063
Get cracking and ignite
those photos, yes?

21:51.567 --> 21:54.653
JULY 15TH (THURS) 4:30 PM

21:53.652 --> 21:54.674
All right,
I'm heading out for a bit.

21:56.196 --> 21:58.072
Where are you going?

21:58.240 --> 22:00.700
To find our leads
as soon as possible,

22:00.784 --> 22:03.328
I'll investigate where
each missing person was last seen.

22:03.787 --> 22:05.914
A person, no matter
how hard he or she tries,

22:05.956 --> 22:07.749
can never escape
their innate personality.

22:09.126 --> 22:10.919
There's no question,
he will make his move.

22:13.464 --> 22:16.091
JULY 15TH (THURS) 4:52 PM

22:17.843 --> 22:19.261
<i>I'll catch him…</i>

22:19.386 --> 22:22.055
<i>I'll find my proof
that Dad isn't Dad</i>

22:22.306 --> 22:23.557
<i>I promise I will.</i>

23:38.882 --> 23:42.010
EPISODE 34
JULY 15TH (THURS), PART 4
